## OllamaProxy: runtime-generated effective configuration
# The proxy writes its fully-resolved configuration here on startup when
# WriteEffectiveConfig is enabled. It may contain plaintext secrets (those that
# came from appsettings, not from environment variables), so it must never be committed.
appsettings.generated.json
**/appsettings.generated.json

